                    appoint_generalist_solo:`Appoint Marcus Reeve (generalist) — the unit needs a manager; clinical leads can advise him`,
                    appoint_generalist_deputy:`Appoint Marcus Reeve as Director with a senior clinician as deputy — management in charge, clinician advising`,
